  "goodToKnow": "Der Rechtsschutz is legal protection: effektiver Rechtsschutz, guaranteed by Article 19(4) of the Grundgesetz, which lets anyone challenge state action in court. The Rechtsschutzversicherung (legal expenses insurance) is very common in Germany and covers lawyers' and court fees in disputes with landlords, employers or after car accidents. Union members often get Rechtsschutz through their union. It has no plural."
